6. In the real `OZ_WORK_REFRESH` route, after durable `beginWorkSessionRefresh()` succeeds:

- schedule a one-shot `WORK_SESSION_REFRESH_WAKE_ALARM` for the post-runtime generation;
- use `persistAcrossSessions: true` when supported, with a compatibility fallback alarm create;
- initiate `chrome.tabs.reload(tab)` on the exact owner AI tab;
- if tab reload fails: clear the alarm, move matching `recovering` session to `error`, remove the matching recovery record, emit `WORK_SESSION_REFRESH_TAB_RELOAD_FAILED`, and DO NOT call runtime.reload;
- after owner-tab reload is accepted, emit `WORK_SESSION_REFRESH_TAB_RELOAD_SCHEDULED`;
- only then schedule `chrome.runtime.reload()`;
- successful route response includes:
  `page_reload_scheduled: true`,
  `runtime_reload_scheduled: true`,
  and `wake_alarm_scheduled`.

